rem Test palette and PALETTECOLOR commands
rem Validates palette selection and individual color customization

rem Test 1: Basic palette selection
palette colodore
wait 100ms

rem Test 2: Different palette
palette pepto_ntsc
wait 100ms

rem Test 3: Another palette variant
palette vice_new
wait 100ms

rem Test 4: Custom palette color - set background to black
PALETTECOLOR 0, 0, 0, 0
wait 100ms

rem Test 5: Custom palette color - set white
PALETTECOLOR 1, 255, 255, 255
wait 100ms

rem Test 6: Custom palette color - set blue
PALETTECOLOR 6, 0, 0, 170
wait 100ms

rem Test 7: Custom palette color - set light blue  
PALETTECOLOR 14, 128, 192, 255
wait 100ms

rem Test 8: Multiple color customizations in sequence
PALETTECOLOR 2, 255, 0, 0
PALETTECOLOR 5, 0, 255, 0
PALETTECOLOR 7, 255, 255, 0
wait 100ms

stop
